  * @data_rate: vendor PHY bandwidth in bits/s per trio, not V4L2 link frequency
  * @settle_count: already resolved 16-bit hardware counter, not nanoseconds
  *
- * This backend is not yet connected to endpoint parsing or stream-on. Sensor
- * timing conversion and RX clock voting must be verified before integration.
  * Validate all inputs before any MMIO, including values that would truncate.
  * Caller serializes configuration and stop. No combo mode or polarity swap.
